# Line-ending policy for InternFlow.
#
# "* text=auto" tells Git to detect text files, store them normalized (LF) in
# the repository, and render them with native endings in working copies
# (CRLF on Windows for users with core.autocrlf=true). This makes the policy
# explicit and consistent for every collaborator, independent of local Git
# configuration, and prevents accidental committing of mixed line endings.
#
# Binary formats are declared so Git never touches their contents.

* text=auto

*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.zip  binary
*.jar  binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
